'''90 Million DL Special Capsules''' (9000万ダウンロード記念選抜ガチャ, ''9000 Man Daunrōdo Kinen Senbatsu Gacha'', '''90 Million Downloads Anniversary Selection Gacha''') was a [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] event added in [[Version 13.2 Update|Version 13.2]]. It featured [[D'artanyan (Uber Rare Cat)|D'artanyan]] along with three units each from the regular Rare Cat Capsule events in addition to all of the non-collab [[:Category:Legend Rare Cats|Legend Rare]] units.

